Academic / dataset notice
-------------------------
This repository is intended for educational and defensive IDS research only.

The CICIDS2017 dataset (or any subset included here) remains the property of
its authors and the Canadian Institute for Cybersecurity (CIC), University of
New Brunswick. When using or redistributing those data, cite:

  Sharafaldin, I., Lashkari, A. H., & Ghorbani, A. A. (2018).
  Toward Generating a New Intrusion Detection Dataset and Intrusion Traffic
  Characterization. ICISSP.
  https://www.unb.ca/cic/datasets/ids-2017.html

Users must comply with CIC / UNB terms of use for the dataset.
